{"id":"vod_lz_14571","vodId":"14571","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"假面骑士01 普通话版","name_cn":"假面骑士01 普通话版","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220507-1/2eee9aff5719481821db0e342a980ffb.jpg"},"summary":"这是新时代骑士与人工智能的正面交锋。故事背景设定为迎来新时代的日本。引领人工智能潮流的公司——“飞电智能”，研发了一款AI机器人，并将其投入到实际运用中。它们完美融入了职场，把新时代朝着电子化的方向推进。但妄图灭绝人类的恐怖分子“灭亡迅雷站”黑了机器人的系统使之暴走。在这样的情况下，政府成立了专门针对AI犯罪的人工智能特务机关，来镇压暴走的AI机器人，维持治安。在一系列事件中，以成为搞笑艺人为目标的主角——飞电或人成了中心人物。在被炒鱿鱼的主人公面前出现了一辆无人驾驶的高档车，然后他突然间被告知，自己要继承飞电智能公司社长的宝座……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-05-07 21:10:13","playable":true,"episodeCount":46,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220507/15112_8321ea56/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220507/15109_edccc584/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220507/15111_bc196b70/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220507/15113_3110b20f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220507/15115_fdea2fbe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220507/15114_dd8cd792/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220507/15117_92b731cc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220507/15116_79c33280/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220507/15118_5f9e49ca/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220507/15123_2788a6db/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220507/15119_9dbee631/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220507/15120_eb78be32/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220507/15121_fed16d75/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220507/15124_0c2375cf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","